  {system: "Gorilla / BFCL", url: "https://github.com/ShishirPatil/gorilla", overlap: "API/tool invocation training and evaluation, APIBench/BFCL; relevant benchmark and prior work for real tool-selection labels, not same schema-overlap predictor."},
